Verse 2:
[Eb][Bb7]There [Eb]everlasting [Ab]spring [Bb]abides,
[Bb7][Eb]And [Ab]never [Eb][Bb7]with'ring [Eb]flowers,
[Eb]And [Ab]but [Eb]a [Ab]little [Bb]space divides
[Bb7][Cm]This [C]heav'nly [Eb]land [Bb7]from [Eb]ours.

Verse 3:
